            "review_text": "mindy m\n18 contributions\n0\nFantastic craft beer bar\nJul 2024 • Friends\nThis is my second visit in a few days. What a hidden gem. Massive choice of craft beer, great decor and a balcony overlooking the lake. There’s a few craft beer bars in the old quarter now but really impressed how roomy this place is. Well worth a visit. Although it’s in a prime location it can be easily missed but 100% worth it.\nWritten July 22, 2024",
